Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

Downloaded the rxa-23.zip to my D:\tmp drive.  I unzipped it into D:\tmp\rxa.  Moved the unzipped
files in D:\tmp\rxa. We copied the following files from the jars directory and checked them into
adks/tivoli/rxa/2.3 in cmvc:

ssh.jar
jlanclient.jar
remoteaccess.jar

Downloaded the following jar from the website and checked it into CMVC as well:

rxa-langpack.jar

